CHAPTER.VERS:
And Moses said to the people, Remember this day, in which you

          {+}
         came out from Egypt, out of the house of slaves; for by strength of hand Yahweh brought you

          {+}
         out from this place: there will be no leavened bread eaten.

This day you

          {+}
         go forth in the month Abib.

And Moses took the bones of Joseph with him: for he had straitly sworn the sons of Israel, saying, God will surely visit you

          {+}
        ; and you

          {+}
         will carry up my bones away from here with you

          {+}
        .
